    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 107,
        "text": "Hi Lisa, thanks for coming to the community centre meeting. We need to talk about the park clean-up day.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "214ee88afce5ba2e82d75563e85ae2e4632fea0ce95f918c9b3f1f81eb3f3d24",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 111,
        "sourceEnd": 191,
        "text": "Sure, Tom. I heard the council might not provide gloves this year. Is that true?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "b14bb7e92b08867a8079bc6551015dbcfac2fce7b0cdf89a8773a653f05acc17",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 195,
        "sourceEnd": 352,
        "text": "Well, they said they would if we asked early, but we didn't. So we have to buy our own. If we had asked in January, they would have given us gloves for free.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "57c347ebfb6d11d20cf4294227dc1daff4951e7919e0c14e7dff0a994c8198dc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 356,
        "sourceEnd": 490,
        "text": "That's a shame. But we can still ask local shops for donations. If we ask the hardware store, they might give us a discount on gloves.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "9f0397f657a69df1708f34f600e26e3ae9a84b1dc08f6c9c7bd2feff8d21c115",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 494,
        "sourceEnd": 595,
        "text": "Good idea. I'll ask them tomorrow. Also, we need more volunteers. Last year only fifteen people came.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "129605f6668012750300b431362f89699d5a5579bdf31240f1463ac9a0c283f6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 599,
        "sourceEnd": 656,
        "text": "Fifteen? I thought it was fifty. That's a big difference.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "a67e0c9f188df6dbee24d309f27b53d32cc0bac9a0877b9e3ffe6fcd2a7a4f08",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 660,
        "sourceEnd": 752,
        "text": "No, it was fifteen. If we had more volunteers, we could finish in two hours instead of four.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "dc6b1390d12636f3360748bfcd01d3522786386b7d09c19931436ae85db8202a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 756,
        "sourceEnd": 859,
        "text": "Right. So how can we get more people? Maybe we could put up posters in the library and the supermarket.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "6d952b874a1f3cc377f42dc1e11bbd9133d1d3ad208d6b387e1f4b3579a70c8f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 863,
        "sourceEnd": 977,
        "text": "Yes, and we could also post on the community Facebook group. If we post a fun video, more young people might join.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "d0d7a9c0489afd5f8d7ccc84b5145a7d67f60e1f15bb505232a69ff4c0f1973f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 981,
        "sourceEnd": 1099,
        "text": "That sounds good. But we should also think about safety. If it rains, we need to cancel or move to the community hall.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "7f37a834e0e8e05207ae0e4661cbbaa6953df45c6f75b4bcf2b4a332b3cb0acc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1103,
        "sourceEnd": 1200,
        "text": "Agreed. Let's set a rain date for the following Saturday. And we should provide water and snacks.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "d706dccd307502ea5630b5bc5c71a9c7f2dfa1385fce2d92611ccd2a3408cebd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1204,
        "sourceEnd": 1291,
        "text": "I can ask the bakery to donate some bread. If they agree, we can offer free sandwiches.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "f2df82283c9bd29f18b5c10417e62c2e45abf3c326473de71ab6af073bae9e38",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1295,
        "sourceEnd": 1415,
        "text": "Perfect. One more thing: the council said they would collect the rubbish bags if we leave them by the gate before 3 p.m.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "6aa53e0eb90179e4295671521bc3def35ba07546ff92acd255c50f7d1998826f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1419,
        "sourceEnd": 1523,
        "text": "OK. So if we finish by 2:30, they will collect everything. Let's make a plan and share it with everyone.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "b7ecba98639359972de9df57ecc1c2392d04cc6a8d351461b48dd5936f1a8b9b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1527,
        "sourceEnd": 1585,
        "text": "I'll write it up and send it to you tonight. Thanks, Lisa.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "b14da39f695700aef659c07cc87fe60bbdca254852f896fc55a458d36b824c59",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1589,
        "sourceEnd": 1618,
        "text": "No problem. See you tomorrow.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "8068e1cd05a5ee012ba8983c1df68376f30c20ebb003da6bb2ef04c9a6ed59c9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
